main _ , he cried abruptly : ' _ and now mark me _ , ' he added in a slower and more impressive tone ; ' _ beware how you ever utter a word derogatory to the honour of Esther de Medina _ . ' And he quitted the apartment , leaving me in possession of my jewels and of the six hundred pounds also . "
