107953	108061	108075	108076	Old Death	482	" of what use was it to me to know where you lived , or to visit your secret repositories of plunder , unless I had some essentially important motive ? The fact of your having discovered my abode gave me in truth but little uneasiness — for I could have moved elsewhere in a few hours . That fact , however , furnished me with an apparent excuse to force you to conduct me to _ your _ den ; for I knew that were I to acquaint you with my real object in coming here , you would have risked every thing to prevent it ! "
