117114	117165	116969	116970	Mrs. Slingsby	455	" and it is to this Society 's rooms that we are going in the evening to hear that estimable man , Mr. Joshua Sheepshanks , give an account of the mission from which he has just returned . I shall increase my donation by five guineas in this instance . "
