126916	127066	127078	127078	Rainford	489	" A man named Josh Pedler called at Bunce 's this morning early , and wanted to see Mr. Bones , on account of a thief , known as Tim the Snammer , who was to go up before the magistrate to - day ; and it appears that Mr. Bones had promised to get him off . Pedler was in a dreadful way when he heard that we had n't seen any thing of the old man for two or three days ; and he swore that it was all a hoax , and that Bones wanted to stick to the money that had been paid him , and shirk the job . Then comes a girl about an hour afterwards ; and she said she was Tim the Snammer 's wife — Mutton - faced Sal they call her;—and a deuce of a rumpus she made also . "
