290237	290257	290271	290272	Josh Pedler	464	" You do n't mean to say you would like to hear me tell my story , do you ? "
290261	290269	290287	290287	Matilda	561	" I should , by all means , "
290274	290285	290302	290302	she	7754	" And I too —— Oh ! above all things ! "
